{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_043nor_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_043nor_001_1000_p", "source_sha256": "8fdb17e033a2dab65a4cf18b307629bbc382a6bd17d44031d96fca5944349229", "ja": "（今日はアイドル達の仕事の付き添いで、\nプロレス会場に来ている。すごい熱気だ！）", "zh": "（今天我陪伴偶像们工作，\n来到职业摔角的比赛场地。气氛好热烈！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_043nor_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_043nor_001_1001_p", "source_sha256": "840a9a05808009ef4b1356c2f971eca023faeab85d0389a17986c4dce7c3e427", "ja": "ステージの準備はよし、と。\nせっかくだから、試合を見学していこうかな。", "zh": "表演的准备完成了。\n既然都来了，就去看看比赛吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_043nor_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_043nor_001_1002_043nor", "source_sha256": "f4069edc7a14635afd99fa65eb32c63fed561e3912010284689c78485d5ce5f6", "ja": "え～っと、アタシの席は……\nあっ、あった、ココだっ♪", "zh": "我看看～我的座位在……\n啊，找到了，是这里♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_043nor_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_043nor_001_1003_043nor", "source_sha256": "ebb5904f085cd9ae604f40828184496f5ef14876f96ebe01459f050df3599012", "ja": "うう～すごいすごい！\nリング見やすい！　特等席じゃん！？", "zh": "唔唔～好赞好赞！\n擂台看得好清楚！这是特等席吧！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_043nor_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_043nor_001_1004_p", "source_sha256": "dea10c870cf8086dd0c965b4c7383faafe28a9eeef3cbb704558f1016552f153", "ja": "（へえ、若い女の子も観に来てるのか。\nイケメンな選手でも出るのかな？）", "zh": "（哦？有年轻女生来看？\n难道这场有帅气的选手参加吗？）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_043nor_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_043nor_001_1005_se", "source_sha256": "2fa3245dcfe3ab04cc9416a8f84c9f905e9420a421709b20b4db733827c31a2f", "ja": "カーン！", "zh": "当！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_043nor_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_043nor_001_1006_p", "source_sha256": "dcebfbe0bf1d29ca6aba4923f2bf6176febb2d617abbe80b043c9746e1b33313", "ja": "（おっ、始まった！）", "zh": "（哦，开始了！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_043nor_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_043nor_001_1007_043nor", "source_sha256": "ca7370ac3cade988796e8827385d62c391fa6cd77050987f0c837f7d4346db2b", "ja": "いけいけ、チャンピオーン！\nそんなやつに負けるなー！", "zh": "快上啊！冠军──！\n别输给那种家伙──！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_043nor_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_043nor_001_1008_043nor", "source_sha256": "2f778fc7e23f5a5c1a66eb9c53355a0e7fb90d8c2c7e0dd43bd381befbf911e2", "ja": "ああっ、アッパー掌底からのジャンピング・ニー！？\nやっぱり、今日の相手は強いな～！", "zh": "糟糕！上钩掌后接跳跃膝击！？\n今天的对手果真很强～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_043nor_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_043nor_001_1009_p", "source_sha256": "8ab3fe481b016dc6cb993f68102d3319d98bed2cbe715d2db0933b61132593d5", "ja": "（ずいぶんプロレスに詳しいみたいだな。\nおかげで、試合の流れがわかりやすい……）", "zh": "（她似乎对职业摔角很有研究。\n有了她的解说，整个比赛过程变得简单易懂……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_043nor_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_043nor_001_1010_043nor", "source_sha256": "46f205d6272bcb0428a1343e9fe0049a8c5da4d2dd6ec1bd2ce6c3827acbb446", "ja": "チキンウイングフェイスロック！\nかーらーの……。", "zh": "折臂颜面固定！\n然～后～是……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_043nor_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_043nor_001_1011_043nor", "source_sha256": "407d1f5ed1b42ad3c7101b2304cdb74d7d1b61176fa265b9a0451b7c4c340572", "ja": "ローリング・クレイドル～～～！！！\nやった、決まったー！！！", "zh": "翻滚摇篮～～～！！！\n太棒啦！帅呆了！！！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_043nor_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_043nor_001_1012_p", "source_sha256": "efbb7dc816c1224c3e1a51cdb4dd49ffb35b6ec49c933e1771816fe9cb0f451c", "ja": "（それにしても、すごく元気な子だな！\n聞いてるこっちまで、楽しくなってくる……）", "zh": "（不过，她还真是有活力！\n听着听着，连我也开心起来了……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_043nor_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_043nor_001_1013_se", "source_sha256": "6e81c1ce4d22b5a936ba221391a49f99debfb15c74b13ec78d2a2abfb9063081", "ja": "ガツン！", "zh": "喀！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_043nor_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_043nor_001_1014_p", "source_sha256": "f9bf7a73b3b4ed1a337b828f689ca0694825a7e3c199b78ea293e2a160e5f35b", "ja": "うぼあっ！？", "zh": "呜喔啊！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_043nor_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_043nor_001_1015_043nor", "source_sha256": "3a928c56a9ff206e375acfcaeaed37c5969c4e833af33ce4631da56d8c0305be", "ja": "ああっ！？　やだっ、どうしよう！？　思いっきり\n顔面に……ねえ、大丈夫！？　しっかりして～！？", "zh": "啊啊！？糟糕，怎么办！？我竟然用力打到别人的脸……\n喂，你没事吧！？振作点啊～！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_043nor_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_043nor_001_1017_p", "source_sha256": "ea597a9bce7da4c94f981318dab7019465e89b03366e30fde6a5f59f6dd2ede1", "ja": "うーん……はっ！　ここは……？", "zh": "唔……啊！这里是……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_043nor_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_043nor_001_1018_043nor", "source_sha256": "c5ae92a097cd614377105bbd6d543df383869def1db568d9bb03f05d910b490f", "ja": "あっ、気がついた！？\nよかった～！", "zh": "啊，你醒啦！？\n太好了～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_043nor_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_043nor_001_1019_043nor", "source_sha256": "c53fd006e4b382dcacc9d8df77adcd1babd9f0a314455a6e6705ae7dd3dfb21c", "ja": "いきなり気絶しちゃうんだもん！\nビックリしちゃったよ。", "zh": "你突然就昏过去了！\n真是吓坏我了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_043nor_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_043nor_001_1020_043nor", "source_sha256": "88b624979dd325234390f0259f6677e48bf7e3f0b706fd168531788a866ac519", "ja": "でも、ケガは大したことないって。\nたんこぶは、できちゃったかもだけど……。", "zh": "不过，听说你的伤势并不严重。\n但可能会肿起来吧……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_043nor_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_043nor_001_1021_p", "source_sha256": "5ddce989726f91e71c7015583f27918baeffe20f74c281d1ceb8049438142f0e", "ja": "いてて……本当だ。\nえっと、ところで君は……？", "zh": "好痛……真的肿了。\n对了，请问你是……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_043nor_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_043nor_001_1022_043nor", "source_sha256": "1342b4f72b847c57252f4f8d684d83e7a6eb6fe166d2d5fb2618910b572153ff", "ja": "あっ……そうだった。\nアタシ、福田のり子っていいます！", "zh": "啊……对喔。\n我叫做福田法子！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_043nor_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_043nor_001_1023_043nor", "source_sha256": "02bc5f06b9245405a590fab9bbb8ae4412f2030b5e4f620ea4f2ec5c7f27d457", "ja": "今日は、本当にごめんなさい！", "zh": "今天真的很对不起！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_043nor_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_043nor_001_1024_p", "source_sha256": "58b0e970a7154805b730c7b8b8c1de11e8ba344e7e958f428d8b770162b6c66a", "ja": "えっ？", "zh": "什么？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_043nor_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_043nor_001_1025_043nor", "source_sha256": "dcc781eaac3945465ad8a0eba25f92e3b5063fedda826e99b6ed0fefaec969e5", "ja": "覚えてない？　アタシが興奮して振り回した拳が、\nその……思いきり当たっちゃったの。", "zh": "你不记得吗？我当时太过兴奋，用力挥拳，\n结果……直接打到你了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_043nor_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_043nor_001_1026_p", "source_sha256": "3373e21ac0bbc8e7a323de7a146470613ae5c5505e6ff51503cfec8efbbb59d4", "ja": "あっ……そうか、会場で……思い出した。\nあの後、気絶しちゃったのか……。", "zh": "啊……对了，在摔角比赛时……我想起来了。\n原来之后我就昏倒了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_043nor_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_043nor_001_1027_043nor", "source_sha256": "57370a80ae2a0032214f0a9291d4bab2c3a337c4b77444449eb85e1b0d2a506c", "ja": "そういうコト！\nもう、本当のほんっとーにごめんなさい！", "zh": "就是这样！\n我真的真──的很对不起！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_043nor_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_043nor_001_1028_043nor", "source_sha256": "5dccd59959c79e9160b095356de81c0962fe8c059ea2225765aaa23a52310c6f", "ja": "お詫びに、アタシにできるコトなら\nなんでもするから、許してっ！", "zh": "我愿意做任何事情赔罪，\n原谅我！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_043nor_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_043nor_001_1029_p", "source_sha256": "a1d6f21bf20ca241d2e224bdc5d263549b29188512bf58ebe4ffb1d515adea64", "ja": "なんでも？\nそうか。それなら……", "zh": "任何事情？\n我懂了。这样的话……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_043nor_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_043nor_001_1030", "source_sha256": "2e6a9d469bc916732e89e6cb2ad4f4661ac486daf30c4b89ee237c946b1b4fd6", "ja": "名刺を差し出す", "zh": "递出名片", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_043nor_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_043nor_001_2000_p", "source_sha256": "eb46ff1e3fd29f86b9401cfaeff465ee0cae8a29931d64b9c46580c6af7a8bb5", "ja": "実は俺は、こういうものなんだけど。\n君、アイドルに興味ないかな？", "zh": "其实我是做这行的。\n不知道你对偶像有没有兴趣？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_043nor_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_043nor_001_2001_043nor", "source_sha256": "c008aac025589216cc9bbbd1631bb548bcb8318c4fc9139aace6cf9622a4902c", "ja": "へっ？\nアイドルって……あ、アタシが！？", "zh": "呃？\n偶像……我、我吗！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_043nor_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_043nor_001_2002_043nor", "source_sha256": "871cffd7f2efe18d89304846181c3170eada8bff37beaf2d6d73e913d9be2778", "ja": "も、もう、冗談言わないでよ～！？　アタシなんて\nガサツだし乱暴だし、アイドルなんて柄じゃ……。", "zh": "真、真是的，别跟我开玩笑啦～！！\n我这么粗鲁又暴力，不适合当偶像啦……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_043nor_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_043nor_001_2003_p", "source_sha256": "1daaf92aaa66ee2ae809e060241b48fa19bd293f5321cbd24ff571945fc4099a", "ja": "君がレスラーを応援している声を聞いてたら、\nなんだか元気をもらえたんだ。", "zh": "当时在旁边听你为摔角选手加油，\n我的精神也跟着振奋起来了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_043nor_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_043nor_001_2004_p", "source_sha256": "f4f836640687c7eeebd9fece7aa65293ff3eb16fdc60921f079e0e64fe532753", "ja": "誰かを本気で応援できる人は、\nアイドルにピッタリだと思う！", "zh": "我认为像你这种能尽全力替人加油的人，\n非常适合来当偶像！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_043nor_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_043nor_001_2005_043nor", "source_sha256": "3999a5bfd028ff35b9f32b38c9ccb7da685e62f634288e465eda8261c3c730f7", "ja": "アタシの声が、元気を……？", "zh": "我的加油声，会让人精神振奋……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_043nor_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_043nor_001_2006_043nor", "source_sha256": "ace235abdd0b684cb1d28f9f387e200524c0f08a46d27f79f8b0686b9fd95c52", "ja": "そ、そっか……えへへ、そうなんだ。\nそんな風に言われると、なんか照れるね♪", "zh": "是、是吗……嘿嘿，这样啊。\n听你这么说，还真有点难为情耶♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_043nor_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_043nor_001_2007_p", "source_sha256": "0ca43c0ddfe621663c31447781fe07e8e0a006d271f1ed82cff2c9cbdc7f1fe4", "ja": "それに、アイドルになれば、\n格闘技関係の仕事もできるかもしれないし……。", "zh": "而且，当上偶像之后，\n或许也能接到与格斗技有关的工作……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_043nor_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_043nor_001_2008_043nor", "source_sha256": "8230b1d96f46f8f509413fb8d75e4beaf0c5d52eb5535163911bfc0644065016", "ja": "格闘技関係の仕事！？\n……それって、試合とか近くで観られる！？", "zh": "与格斗技有关的工作！？\n……意思是说，有机会近距离看比赛吗！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_043nor_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_043nor_001_2009_p", "source_sha256": "0217f9218d5868dc9f07dea132e5645ca86d9d40bfeee6f2426da353ba839528", "ja": "ああ、俺も今日はアイドルの付き添いで来てたんだ。\nだから、君もアイドルに……。", "zh": "是啊，像我今天就是陪其他偶像过来的。\n所以，要是你也来当偶像……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_043nor_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_043nor_001_2010_043nor", "source_sha256": "4a45ed0046b39d9dcf293a69567597bc2dfe44ee9347ed309694dd70e1fb4df0", "ja": "……いいよ、乗った！\nアタシ、アイドルになるっ！", "zh": "……好啊，成交！\n我要当偶像！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_043nor_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_043nor_001_2011_p", "source_sha256": "5e159af0f9933eba57938872f955f756110211f925e948ffe7b1373b8aa9b1d0", "ja": "本当に？", "zh": "真的吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_043nor_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_043nor_001_2012_043nor", "source_sha256": "93bbb88af220aec60aeff1b04547a60f541812e73b127f9d2f695392f0019de9", "ja": "うんっ！　アタシみたいな女の子が、\nアイドルになれるかどうか、わからないけど……。", "zh": "嗯！虽然我不知道像我这样的女生\n是不是真的能当好偶像……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_043nor_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_043nor_001_2013_043nor", "source_sha256": "c5b0818c06e9cadd1b03227ff93ede6f4cd3ccd7fd8431a7063b5fe561a8d89e", "ja": "でも、人生一度きりだしね。\nとにかく挑戦してみるよ！", "zh": "不过，人生只有一次嘛。\n不管怎样，先挑战看看再说！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_043nor_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_043nor_001_2014_p", "source_sha256": "ebc0b829957ab7b92e829d5aff6c92afab8c5daa44fd09cdbba9eb3a9efa2312", "ja": "そうか……ありがとう！\nのり子さん、だったね。これからよろしく！", "zh": "这样啊……谢谢你！\n你是法子小姐，没错吧？以后还请多指教了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_043nor_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_043nor_001_2015_043nor", "source_sha256": "501036c14e9acf870eb14d5f6514eaf4529d9f3e4c4acc670407108914c53c6a", "ja": "『のり子』でいいよ！\nこちらこそよろしくねっ、えっと……プロデューサー！", "zh": "叫我『法子』就好了啦！\n我才要请你多指教啰，呃……制作人！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_043nor_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_043nor_001_2016_p", "source_sha256": "23df69390c1bc98dd8669b9a4759f1562293b8689dfc404bdc639edc91579f13", "ja": "（ユニークな子が入ってくれた。\n39プロジェクトも、賑やかになりそうだ！）", "zh": "（找到一个有特色的女孩加入了。\n39PROJECT以后应该会越来越热闹吧！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
